WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.075
Four days to Tranquility Base.

00:02.762 --> 00:05.980
Apollo 11 left this pad in the morning, Florida time.

00:06.492 --> 00:10.932
Four days later two of its three astronauts landed in the Sea of Tranquility.

00:11.549 --> 00:14.158
All three were home eight days after the launch.
